 up ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/
 her best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/or spl
 itting into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do no
 t join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exc
 eed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to joi
 n a faster group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph average is beyond your curren
 t ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets 
 are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spar
