SUMMARY:Annual Strawberry Festival/ Ice Cream ride 13 miles flat RSVP Requ
 ired
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nIt is time to do our annu
 al Sunday Evening Strawberry Festival Ride. For the tenth year\, family fr
 iendly bicycle ride from Lititz to Salem Church in Manheim for the all you
  can eat strawberries and ice cream! By donation to the church's mission t
 rip for youth. We will ride together as a group. This is a casual ride. Do
  not sign up for this ride unless you will stay with the group. No one lef
 t behind. Like always helmets are required and bring what you need to chan
 ge a flat.\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we enco
 urage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. RSVP al
 so allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do not RSVP y
 ou are not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy\; only clu
 b members who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a cl
 ub member. Join here- https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_
 id=60&club_id=257148\n\nQuestions: Richard Conner\, leader 717-572-8480
